WEBVTT

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:33.370
And my family's favorite video?

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.576
Bill Gates.

00:13:36.576 --> 00:13:39.659
Because the night Pete was diagnosed,

00:13:39.659 --> 00:13:47.244
he told us that he was going to get ALS in
front of philanthropists like Bill Gates,

00:13:47.244 --> 00:13:48.790
and he did it.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:51.260
Goal number one, check.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.203
Now on to the treatment and cure.

00:13:53.203 --> 00:13:59.498
(Applause)